  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #f5f0e4; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#ae4a43 0,#ae4a43 12px,#f5f0e4 12px,#f5f0e4 24px,#365d87 24px,#365d87 36px,#f5f0e4 36px,#f5f0e4 48px); box-sizing: border-box; color: #344551; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 10px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: #f5f0e4; box-sizing: border-box; color: #344551; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 26px 22px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #627682; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 26px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 24px 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #344551; display: block; font-size: 17px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e整圈红白蓝斜纹沿着信纸四边一路环绕，拆开这一页，就像收到一封跨越山海的航空来信。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/summer-coast.jpg\" alt=\"阳光海岸碧蓝泳池与洁白遮阳伞\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 32px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #365d87; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e四边环绕的真实邮笺感\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #344551; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e区别于普通上下装饰条，四面完整的航空斜纹外框赋予整篇游记独一无二的信封轮廓。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background-color: #e3e7e6; border: 1px dashed #365d87; color: #344551; font-size: 19px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 24px; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e把远方的风、海浪和街角咖啡香，一并装进航空信封寄给你。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 32px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #365d87; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e航空邮笺的特色场景\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e旅行游记、海外生活通讯与城市漫步\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e读者来信专栏与周期性 Newsletter\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e经典红蓝配色，百搭风景与人文照片\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #627682; color: #365d87; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: right\"\u003e下一站盖上新邮戳时，再提笔给你写信。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
